    "text": "55 minutes ago Two public events will feature Tibetan scholar Ngwang Tenpa. He will discuss the relationship between classical literature, culture, and social peace. The talks will address mindful communication, nonviolent language, and the role of tradition in building peaceful societies.\nBoth events are free and open to the public. The goal is to explain how language and cultural heritage can support harmony in communities.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
